Test Scenario 2 — Real-Time Task Creation
                                                                                                                                                                           
In Window A (Name 1, engineering): click "+ New Task". 
Fill in Title: "Build login page", Description: "JWT-based auth", Priority: "High". Click Create Task.

Watch Window B simultaneously. 
The task should appear in the "To Do" column of Number 2's board within milliseconds — no refresh. 

Both windows now show the same task. The To Do count shows 1 on both.

Check Window C (Frank, devops). The task should NOT appear on Frank's board. Group isolation confirmed again.
