Test Scenario 3 — State Recovery After Late Join

Create 3 more tasks in any window on the engineering board using different priorities. 
Then mark one as In Progress and one as Done. 
The board now has tasks in all three columns.

Open a brand new Window D at http://localhost:5000. 
Enter name "Name 5" and board ID "engineering". Click Join.

Watch Window D. 
All tasks that were already on the board should immediately appear in the correct columns — Name 5 sees the full board state without having been present when the tasks were created. 
This is the BoardState delivery working correctly.
